B.aoe=new A.jI("Decks for walk-ins","Random deck gives every new walk-in their own random deck, rolled from the whole part catalog (or your saved combos, via the tune button).\n\nSame deck for all gives everyone the shared deck below; editing it later updates every row that uses it.\n\nAny row can be re-rolled or edited on its own.",B.dv,null,null)
